#: ../../home/insan/projects/guidedog/docs/manual/index.rst:6
msgid "Guidedog builds a documentation website and a PDF book from the same reStructuredText or Markdown files. We keep one set of source files and publish it for readers on the web and on paper. The release provides one ``guidedog`` executable, with PDF typesetting and diagram rendering included."
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/insan/projects/guidedog/docs/manual/index.rst:8
msgid "A small project needs three things: a source document, a table of contents, and ``conf.toml``. Start with :doc:`tutorial/first-project`. For a particular task, use :doc:`howto/index`. For an exact contract, use :doc:`reference/index`."
msgstr ""

